WEBVTT

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.330
Fear not, Mary.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.870
Thou shalt conceive
in thy womb, and bring forth a son,

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.540
and shalt call his name Jesus.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.760
Az? Your lines, your lines.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.760
How shall this be, since I...

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.100
Okay, stop!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.140
Azmaria, I know you're nervous,

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.100
but when you do that, it seems
like you're actually shouting angrily.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.690
I'm sorry.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.900
One more time, from Gabriel's part.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.150
What? Let's take a break.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.900
What are you saying?!

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.700
We're not stopping
until we can get it right!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.830
You guys in the choir
are going to join in too.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.950
Okay, then...

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.460
What now?!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:31.290
I feel the same way.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.880
We don't have the time to rest!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.840
All right, then! Go!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:44.180
I'd like to borrow Azmaria.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.560
Do what you want!

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:56.030
The Nativity play is the highlight
of the Christmas service, after all.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.610
Do your best!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.160
But I don't know if I'll be able
to meet everyone's expectations or not.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.910
Knowing you, it'll be fine, Azmaria.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.830
It would appear that
the pictures were taken in San Francisco.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.500
San Francisco?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:18.130
This month alone, we have lost
contact with three investigators.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:23.090
All of them were members of the Order
who were looking into Aion's situation.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:27.520
There have been repeated
occurrences of abductions and murders,

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.060
and drawing conclusions
from the circumstances and evidence,

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.440
we believe that the devils have something
to do with all of their disappearances.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.070
Something is about to
start on the west coast.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:42.200
Either that, or it's already started.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:48.240
Calm down, Sister Rosette.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.290
After all, that's the reason
you became a Militia, right?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:01.050
Then it's all right for us
to leave here and look for Joshua?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.300
This will lead us to Aion too!

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.470
This time we won't let
him get away, no matter what!

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.930
We'll be sure to bring back Joshua!

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.600
I'll help too.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.310
Right.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.730
Thanks.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.280
There are three
dresses left, but will they fit?

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.990
It's all right,
we'll put them in using our guts!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.280
And besides,
Chrono's the one who'll be carrying it.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.870
What? I hadn't heard that!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.040
Are you planning on making a helpless,
young girl carry such a heavy bag?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.250
It's not like we're
going on vacation, Rosette!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.260
Rosette!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.720
So you really are leaving here.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.020
What? Seriously? Are you serious?

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.270
We'll miss you,

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.350
but this <i>is</i> what you've been
hoping for this whole time, Rosette.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.940
What? Is that so?!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.230
I understand your desire to hurry, Rosette,

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.740
but won't you at least stay until Christmas?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.880
I understand. We'll do that.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.130
Let's have a fun Christmas, okay?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:26.800
Yes, let's.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.800
It looks like this year's
Christmas is going to be memorable.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.560
I'm doing it?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.890
Of course you are!

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.020
Why do you always make me do it?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.990
A feast, a feast!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.280
I'm home.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.240
Well...

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.580
I bought the wine
and the bread for tomorrow.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:06:00.210
Put it in the kitchen.
Your dinner is in there too.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.210
Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:07.300
Hey, how long do we
have to put her up here?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.590
When she sings,
lots of birds gather around!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.470
It's creepy, you know?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.180
You don't know any Christmas carols?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.100
What? Not even one?

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.560
I'm sorry.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.110
It's nothing to apologize for!
We have plenty of time.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.820
All you have to do
is learn them from here on.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.070
Christmas is when we make our money.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.910
And since you're with us this year, Az, it
looks like things are going to be more lively.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.330
Jumping the gun, aren't you?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.130
Isn't this wonderful, Az?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.250
It was a short period
of time, but be well, okay?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.800
Even after you become a high-class lady,
come and see us once in a while, okay?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:53.220
Azmaria! Azmaria!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.430
Azmaria!

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.520
That's no good!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.810
If you look so depressed,
no one will come by.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:08.490
Look, with a PR smile,
like this! Like this, Az!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.490
You don't have to imitate her.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:16.830
Please give donations so that the less
fortunate can have a happy Christmas!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:20.120
Oh, the gentleman over there, wait!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.630
Thank you very much.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:31.760
Everyone! May this
kind-hearted gentleman be blessed!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.260
This isn't street theater,
you know. You're going a little too far!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.390
If we don't go at least
this far, we won't collect anything.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:43.310
Oh, the lady over there!
Please give us a Christmas donation!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.190
Oh, it's you again?

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.150
Well, what are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:53.450
Please be sure to shop here
next year as well, Lady Harvenheit.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.870
Thank you. Have a good year.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.660
Don't tell me, you're a rich girl?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:04.750
Lady Satella is the current head
of the Harvenheit Art Company.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:05.670
No way!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.170
Oh, yes, a donation, right?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.010
Merry Christmas.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.350
Are you sending that many presents?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:25.310
Well, yes.
I have so many different associates.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.360
It's like you're Santa Claus!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.900
Don't tell me that you...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.490
Surely at your age,
you don't still believe in Santa Claus?

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.280
No! That is...

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:40.830
Santa Claus never visited me to begin with.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:46.210
Az, don't tell me that you've never gotten
a present up until now, not even once?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:54.800
But I was a bad girl,
so that might be why he never came.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.260
You mustn't say things like that.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.390
You most certainly are not a bad girl.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.600
The reckless Sister and the tiny devil
over there are a different story, though.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.440
What did you say?!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.730
What, do you have
a problem, reckless Sister?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:16.070
Cut that out! Not out there!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.280
That's right.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.870
This year, I also have
people to give presents to!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.330
A present? Well...

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.080
It really does depend on
the person you're giving it to.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:32.130
Me, me! I want some
new boots and a silk handkerchief!

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.470
Don't be so loud!
It's after bedtime curfew, after all!

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:39.140
And no one said they were
getting you anything, Mary!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.760
Boo...

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.140
Are you giving it to Rosette?

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.440
Yes, and to Chrono as well.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.560
Giving what you want yourself,

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.650
that's the greatest trick
for choosing a present!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:57.110
It might be better to go out and window
shop rather than worry about this and that.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:00.620
That's right, after all, you might
unexpectedly find something good.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.030
I understand!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:05.830
It would be nice
if I found something good.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:10.420
That's right, I'm going shopping tomorrow
to get materials for the costumes in the play,

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.920
so maybe I'll go looking for a bit.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.640
What do you think?

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.150
Wouldn't it be better
to make it a bit bigger?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.360
You've got to make it so that people know

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.650
that you're a reindeer
in one glance, like this!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.780
But they'd come off
too easily if they were big.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:43.330
If your horns weren't broken,
then we'd just attach those to them.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:49.710
I wonder if it's all right for a devil
to celebrate Christmas in the first place?

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.960
It's all right!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.300
Sad people,

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.130
and people in pain,

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.760
adults and children...

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:04.140
Everyone, no matter who
they are, can become happy.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.470
That is the magic of Christmas.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.520
It was a good thing that
we didn't leave here in a hurry.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:16.820
For Azmaria's sake, we have to let her have
a Christmas that will remain in her heart.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:21.910
No, no, it's my eyes that are having
a memory burned into them, not my heart.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.030
Please let the next year be a good one too.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.750
What do you think you're doing,
taking advantage of the confusion,

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.960
you perverted old man?!

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.820
Has something caught your fancy?

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.370
Here, take a look.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.250
It's beautiful.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.750
Would it be strange to
give this as a Christmas present?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.170
Who are you giving it to?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:25.510
Someone who's like an older sister to me.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.010
Something like this
would make a girl happy.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:35.980
I'm sorry, but I don't
have any money right now.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.730
Don't worry about it. Take it with you.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.740
Oh, no, I can't just take it!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.360
I'll get the money on Christmas Eve, so...

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.120
In that case, I'll hold on to it until then.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.120
Be sure to come for it!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.660
I will! Absolutely!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.360
The Holy Ghost shall come upon thee,

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:25.530
and the power of
the Highest shall overshadow thee.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.950
For with God, nothing shall be impossible.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.080
My soul doth magnify the Lord,

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.090
and my spirit hath
rejoiced in God my Savior.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.400
You were really great!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.570
Good work!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.820
You really did well, Azmaria.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.740
Thank you very much.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.090
I did say that I would hold it for you, right?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.970
But I was worried.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.600
Here you are.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:40.270
Excuse me! Did you sell the snow globe
that was in the front window?

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.730
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:46.190
I see, so it's been sold.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.940
If you had said something sooner,

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.700
I could have gotten
the same one in for you.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.370
Now I've done it.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:55.160
And I promised my girlfriend too.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.790
I'm sorry, please excuse me.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.800
You shouldn't worry about it.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.920
But...

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.260
Wait! Please wait!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.310
With this, I can give my girlfriend
the greatest Christmas present.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.270
Thank you very much!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.940
I wish you happiness.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.610
Is it really all right?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.990
Yes, it was just something
I had picked out by myself.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.410
So I hadn't made a promise.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.410
Then go and choose
something in its place.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.670
I'll give you a huge discount on it.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.220
Merry Christmas!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.180
Rosette, Chrono...

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.140
Why don't you get on?

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:10.320
Those presents were gathered
and prepared by everyone at the Order.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.360
It's a yearly custom.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:16.120
We deliver everyone's
gathered feelings as presents.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.990
That's our job on Christmas.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.660
Delivering feelings...

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:27.880
Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:30.420
Everyone's having fun.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.760
It <i>is</i> Christmas, after all.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.770
Merry Christmas!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.060
Have you all been good children?

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.900
We have!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.900
So hurry up and give us our presents!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.410
Here you are, Merry Christmas.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.080
I really wanted this!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.720
So Azmaria had prepared presents for us.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.510
Thank you so much for this!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.220
Me too, thank you, Azmaria.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:27.400
Christmas really was enjoyable!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.270
What are you talking about?
The main event is still to come!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:37.360
Merry Christmas, Azmaria!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.160
Now, now, don't sit there in a daze.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.910
Hurry up, over here.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.790
Tada!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:01.050
For you, a young girl who, up until today,
has never had the blessings of Christmas,

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:05.140
tonight, all of us
present you with this party.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:21.030
We will be praying
for your future happiness.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:33.130
And now, my newest invention!
An electric Christmas tree!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.300
Merry Christmas, Azmaria.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.020
What do you think?
This is a real Christmas.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:48.520
I... I...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.230
What's wrong?!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:57.570
I'm sorry. I'm so very happy.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.490
It's more than I deserve.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:07.160
I have a power other people don't,
and people always hated that.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:12.380
I'm not the kind of person
that's worthy of something like this.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.130
Something so wonderful...

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.960
Azmaria...

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:24.510
Everyone said they wanted to
do something for you, Azmaria.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:28.390
And then, before we knew it,
it turned into a big party!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.350
It's because you're a good person!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.020
That's not something for
you to say, you perverted old man.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:39.530
Everyone, thank you so much!
Thank you very much!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.750
"This idol of a deity is a charm
against evil that is known of in Africa.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.960
It seems like you're
easily targeted by evil people,

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:59.710
so use it for your
own protection. Satella Harvenheit."

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:02.010
That woman!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.140
It's incredibly scary.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.510
Just hurry up and chuck it.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.430
It feels like I'm going to be cursed.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.850
Chrono, you can be cursed too?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:36.040
It might have been a while
since Azmaria's smiled like that.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.130
Yeah.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:42.090
It would be nice to do
this next year, with Joshua.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.050
Yeah.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:51.310
Merry Christmas, Chrono.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:56.560
Then from me too.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.780
Thank you, Chrono.
